🔐 Password Strength Classification
This project builds a machine learning model to classify password strength into categories such as weak, medium and strong.
It focuses on transforming raw text passwords into numerical features and evaluating different classifiers.

📌 Features
Text preprocessing and cleaning
Character-level feature extraction
Vectorization of passwords
Training multiple ML models
Evaluation of classification performance

🛠 Tools Used
Python · Pandas · NumPy · Scikit-learn · Jupyter Notebook

📁 Main File
Password Strength.ipynb — complete preprocessing, modeling and evaluation
